	"notes": [
		{
			"id": "AfUMM6xA8F_MGIiqM",
			"text": "Typical Stats from the reviewed package: ST 7, DX 13, IQ 9, HT 10, HP 7, WILL 9, PER 9, FP 10, SPEED 5.75, MOVE 5, DODGE 8, DR 0. GCS derives its own values by applying the ancestry; where the two differ, the package's Typical Stats are what the Dungeons on Automatic encounter tables use."
		},
